title Ask-SLM System Context (Notebook and CLI)

participant Engineer
participant RunnerNotebook as Notebook
participant RunnerPipeline as Workflow
participant InputsFolder as Inputs
participant MappingConfigs as Configs
participant Workspace as Workspaces
participant ManagersUI as Managers
participant CLI
participant AnalysisLayer as Analysis

Engineer->Notebook: Run notebook cells for selected view
Notebook->Workflow: initialize_runner_context(view_name)
Workflow->Workspace: Prepare view-scoped folders
Notebook->Workflow: prepare_workspace_inputs()
Workflow->Inputs: Read metadata/taxonomy CSV parts
Workflow->Workspace: Write canonical metadata.csv/taxonomy.csv
Notebook->Workflow: run enrichment, taxonomy, merge stages
Workflow->Configs: Read mapping JSON per project
Workflow->Workspace: Write results, cache stamps, logs
Notebook->Managers: Launch interactive managers
Managers->Workspace: Read merged artifacts and write exports

Engineer->CLI: Execute askslm.py command
CLI->Inputs: Load metadata.csv and taxonomy.csv for view
CLI->Configs: Apply per-project mapping configs
CLI->Analysis: Run pure compute functions
CLI->Workspace: Write CSV/HTML outputs under results/<view>/